<title>USA: IBM opens down 1-3/8 on NYSE.</title>
<headline>IBM opens down 1-3/8 on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of International Business Machines Corp opened down 1-3/8 to 128 on the New York Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>Shares closed on Friday on the NYSE at 129-3/8, up 3-3/4.</p>
<p>The computer giant posted earnings of $2.45 per share for the third quarter, compared with $2.30 a year ago, before charges.</p>
<p>The First Call consensus for the quarter was $2.43.</p>
</text>
